# Facts about Professor Brask.

@fact brask.beasts
tier: surface
text: Teaches Beastcraft & Flight from the stables, and talks to every creature in them more kindly than to students.

@fact brask.stories
tier: personal
hint: Let her tell you a story. Wait for the end.
unlock: seen(brask_shovel) > 0
text: Every one of her stories ends with a bite and a moral. She laughs out loud about once a term.

@fact brask.owl
tier: personal
hint: Visit the stable loft at night.
unlock: seen(brask_night_owl) > 0
text: The old barn owl in the stable loft has outlived three of her colleagues. She would not say which loss hurt most.

@fact brask.courtesies
tier: personal
hint: She has manners for things that live in the wood.
unlock: seen(brask_trust) > 0
text: She bows to the things that live in the Whisperwood, and believes it's why they have never bitten her. Much.

@fact brask.feather
tier: personal
hint: She lost something in the Whisperwood one winter.
unlock: seen(item_quill_brask) > 0
text: Her barn owl moulted in the Whisperwood one winter, and she looked for the lost flight feather for a month.

@fact brask.blackthorn
tier: secret
hint: She knows wands by more than their look.
unlock: seen(item_thorn_brask) > 0
text: She knows a blackthorn wand by its smell, and she knows the woman in the wood who cuts them.
